  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Conventional infantry within the DCMS serve as the foundation of planetary defense, providing the manpower essential to territorial control while freeing BattleMech and armored assets for offensive operations. The platoon's field gun is the heaviest ultra autocannon available, capable of delivering two rounds in rapid succession that can gut a vehicle or strip armor from a BattleMech in a single burst. The jamming risk under rapid fire is a known hazard that crews train around.</p>"
